VERSION 3 — first substantial upgrade
Replaced the primary experience with a responsive browser-local cinema app. Included 44 curated films, local posters, search/filter/sort controls, moods, favourites, watchlist, watched status, personal-film additions, CSV import and export, taste views and explainable recommendations.
Recommendation model combined genre, language and era attributes with a catalogue-rating component. Affinity was labelled similarity, not predicted enjoyment.
Application dependencies, API keys and databases were avoided. Static build output became the deployable source. Historical Python code was retained under legacy/ and excluded from the public build.
Eight model tests and 26 browser assertions were recorded for this version.
The private Sites project was established at https://mrs-by-letterboxd-cinema.just-hill-8226.chatgpt.site. The original Vercel project was not replaced.
