User requested a ZIP only after approval of the final files. No new version 5 source ZIP is created before that approval. A deployment tar archive is a hosting artifact, not the requested downloadable source ZIP.
Credentials, platform bypass tokens, personal browser profiles and raw private runtime details are intentionally excluded from all project documents and source artifacts.

